markdown <<MARKDOWN
<h1>Begin with the End in Mind: Final Project Overview</h1>

<p>Foundations of Programming with AI ends with a cumulative <strong>Reactive Logic Project</strong>. </p>

<p>Over five days, students design and build an interactive app that responds to user input with different outcomes, badges, or messages. They plan with a flowchart, build, test, peer-review using TAG (Tell / Ask / Give), and finalize.<br><br> Every unit concept comes together here: event-driven design, variables, functions, and conditionals, including combined conditions.</p>

---

<h2>Sample Project</h2>
<p><em>Click the ingredients and see what happens.</em></p>

<div style="width:100%; border-radius:10px; overflow:hidden; margin:20px 0;">
  <iframe src="https://amandadennard-dotcom.github.io/Unit5AIF2/trail-mix-badge-builder-v2.html" width="100%" height="700" style="border:none;" title="Trail Mix Badge Builder sample project"></iframe>
</div>

<div style="clear:both;"></div>

---

<p><strong>When the project begins:</strong> Final lesson of the unit, extending over five class periods.</p>

<div style="background-color:#F5F5F7; border-radius:10px; padding:18px 20px; margin:24px 0;">
  <h2>Students Will:</h2>
  <ul style=" margin:14px 0 0 1.1rem; padding:0;">
    <li style="margin-bottom:12px;">Implement core interactivity using event handlers, variables, conditional logic, and DOM updates</li>
    <li style="margin-bottom:12px;">Expand their app with nested conditionals, logical operators, and parameterized functions to handle more complex rules</li>
    <li style="margin-bottom:12px;">Plan interactive features by defining criteria and creating flowcharts that model their logic</li>
    <li style="margin-bottom:12px;">Test and refine their app systematically, debugging errors, evaluating AI output, and revising for accessibility and inclusivity</li>
    <li style="margin-bottom:0;">Reflect on their development process, documenting effective AI use and assessing how well their app meets its original goals</li>
  </ul>
</div>

<p>This project lets students apply their design and coding skills in a creative, authentic way while learning how AI can support the web development process.</p>

<h2>Now, Let's See How We Get Here</h2>






